      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STEEL STRIDE (6) made an encouraging return to racing when he came from the back row and was 3 metres away in third at this venue. Has won when second-up before so expect him to be improved. Has the ability to take care of this field. LOOKIN GOOD MARGIE (3) enjoys a class drop off a Breeders Challenge semi-final at Menangle last time out. Went close from a similar barrier here prior so is better placed. FINAL PROMISE (4) produced a strong effort at his latest appearance when successful at this circuit, getting home by 3 metres after leading. Draws a couple of spots wider but is a chance to make it two on the trot. ROCKET RALPH (7) draws for a trail and is in the mix after turning in a good effort last start when beaten less than 2m into third at this circuit and distance.",
